    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-E0654A21700F52F4-Q6">
      <question_stem>그림의 직렬회로에서 저항 $R$ [Ω]과 리액턴스 $X$ [Ω]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>v ( t )</keyword>
        <keyword>i ( t )</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$10 \sqrt{3}$ $10$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기이론 · 직렬회로의 저항과 리액턴스
정답은 ③이다. 임피던스 크기는 |Z| = Vm/Im = 40/2 = 20 Ω이고, 전류가 전압보다 30° 뒤지므로 위상각은 30°이다. R = 20cos30° = 10√3 Ω, X = 20sin30° = 10 Ω이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$5 {\sqrt{3}}$ $5$</choice_text>
          <commentary>임피던스 크기를 10 Ω으로 계산하였다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$5 {\sqrt{3}}$ $5 {\sqrt{3}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$10 \sqrt{3}$ $10$</choice_text>
          <commentary>10√3 Ω, 10 Ω이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$10 \sqrt{3}$ $10 \sqrt{3}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>리액턴스가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="7" id="PRB-E0654A21700F52F4-Q7">
      <question_stem>그림의 회로에서 전류 $I$ [A]와 전압 $V$ [V]는?</question_stem>
